The original repository contributed the initial pipeline architecture: the
Docker Compose topology, the extract/load DAG, the dbt staging and mart models,
and the README's architecture documentation.

Subsequent work in this repository -- data contracts for all nine tables,
typed and sampled contract validation, the dbt run/test tasks inside Airflow,
named volumes and container healthchecks, the TRUNCATE-and-append load
strategy, dim_geography, expanded schema tests, the synthetic dataset
generator, and the implementation and study guides -- is by Amruth Ganta.
